# Design-system galleries

Public AI rules (no repository): `/design-system/llms`
In-repo notes: `src/components/app/design-system/AGENTS.md`

- `/[locale]/design-system` — Brand Book. Spec: `.claude/rules/brand.md`
- `/[locale]/design-system/components` — UI kit using real product components.
  Spec: `.claude/rules/design-system.md`

Do not copy gallery markup into feature components. Reuse `@/components/ui`
and tokens from `src/app/globals.css`. Update the components gallery when a
shared component changes. Update `DESIGN_SYSTEM_LLMS.ts` when external-agent
rules change.
